{"study_accession":"PRJNA201433","secondary_study_accession":"SRP022133","title":"Identification of differentially expressed transcripts and pathways one week and six months following implant of left ventricular devices","description":"A specific set of genes involved in regulating cellular immune response, antigen presentation, and T cell activation and survival were down-regulated 7 days after LVAD placement. 6 months following LVAD placement, the expression levels of these genes were significantly increased; yet importantly, remained significantly lower than age and sex-matched samples from healthy controls. Overall design: Examination of the effect of LVAD implant on peripheral blood transcriptome. Blood was drawn before LVAD placement, 7 days post implant, and 180 days post implant. RNA sequencing was performaed on all samples.","pubmed":"24205042","geo_series":"","n_samples":25,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN02117493","study_accession":"PRJNA201433","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Sample_1_0","description":"Sample_1_0","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM1133660","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2013-06-12","attributes":[["source_name","Sample_1_0"],["time","pre-LVAD"],["tissue","whole blood"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR846935","experiment_accession":"SRX275432","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":13446831,"base_count":2689366200,"first_public":"2013-06-12","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM1133660: Sample_1_0 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN02117494","study_accession":"PRJNA201433","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Sample_1_7","description":"Sample_1_7","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM1133661","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2013-06-12","attributes":[["source_name","Sample_1_7"],["time","7 days post LVAD"],["tissue","whole blood"]],"runs":[{"run_accessio